    {
      "id": "prerequisites",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 90,
      "y": 835,
      "width": 570,
      "height": 170,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#102A43",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "SYSTEM PREREQUISITES\n\n• OCI IAM read access is scoped to the intended tenancy, compartments, and telemetry resources.\n• Signal collection, retention, clocks, and the investigation time window are validated before querying.\n• Resource ownership and escalation routes are mapped before an operational action is assigned.\n• Required log sources, parsers, entities, and log groups are enabled in Logan.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "SYSTEM PREREQUISITES\n\n• OCI IAM read access is scoped to the intended tenancy, compartments, and telemetry resources.\n• Signal collection, retention, clocks, and the investigation time window are validated before querying.\n• Resource ownership and escalation routes are mapped before an operational action is assigned.\n• Required log sources, parsers, entities, and log groups are enabled in Logan.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
