      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "EMPTY-RESULT CAVEAT\n\nAn empty result is inconclusive and does not prove absence. Confirm permissions, tenancy and compartment scope, region, collection health, parser and field mappings, and the time window before widening or simplifying the query.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "EMPTY-RESULT CAVEAT\n\nAn empty result is inconclusive and does not prove absence. Confirm permissions, tenancy and compartment scope, region, collection health, parser and field mappings, and the time window before widening or simplifying the query.",
